title: "QNHS: Quantum-Neuromorphic Hybrid Substrate simulation suite"
abstract: >-
  Simulation code, unit tests and a hardware security threat model for a
  nanoscale quantum-neuromorphic hybrid substrate: energy with cooling cost,
  Q-STDP learning, MTJ device and surface-code coherence models.
